00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.150
Really relatable stuff for all of us.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.110
If I were to cold-pitch

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:49.943
this concept to you,

00:00:49.943 --> 00:00:51.210
