00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.043
it would become one of

00:00:52.043 --> 00:00:53.430
the funniest shows on television.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.140
But, somehow, it has.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.000
- I got a (beep) wife.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:57.930
A (beep) kid now.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:58.763
Look at this, look.

00:00:58.763 --> 00:00:59.760
- Oh, that's (beep) crazy.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:00.672
He looks just (beep) like you.

00:01:00.672 --> 00:01:01.920
- I (beep) know.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.330
