Shoot that subscribe button

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.334
like there's a tiger in the other room,

00:19:02.334 --> 00:19:04.350
and don't forget to ring that bell.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.580
And as always,

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.367
thanks for watching, later.

